1.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Sample Apartment of Rajputana Paradise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 22718](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/753/Sample%20Apartment/f70c630e75f6d72e98715b92bca6090b.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Sample Apartment of Rajputana Paradise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 22719](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/753/Sample%20Apartment/a7492eca8ae4a5f26bed22d8b6856575.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Sample Apartment of Rajputana Paradise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 22720](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/753/Sample%20Apartment/9e550518f165b40aa369fdc16ca68463.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Location of Rajputana Paradise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 22721](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/753/Location/753_1678021261_f31c5ab22b65835ce7e99dc192b3459c.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n## Project Overview of Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n102 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n0.2 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 24 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nApartment Spaces in Rajputana Paradise allow one to cherish an elite lifestyle belonging to an elite league. Originator Rajputana Associates, with a team of experts, covers every aspect of a fulfilling lifestyle with its foundational values and produces a regal outcome - Rajputana Paradise. In its ordinary meaning, Paradise is a place of Utopia where every available thing is perfect. Following that similar proposition, Rajputana’s Paradise bestows an absolute once-in-a-lifetime experience.   \n  \nSurroundings play a vital role while implementing a residential setup. With Rajputana Paradise, no stone was left unturned for its meticulous placement. Hence, locating it at Kandivali East, Mumbai, Residents of Rajputana Paradise receive all possible conveniences within the vicinity. Western Express Highway, Malad Station, and Charkop metro station are accessible at a distance of a few minutes.  \n  \nAn elite lifestyle isn’t defined by location only; internally available amenities add up to the desired eliteness. Rajputana Paradise provides an elite lifestyle for a privileged league. The modern mapping with spacious lobby is head-turning. Parking area, sit-out space, and individually designated balconies for landscape view all appends to the aspired facilities.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Rajputana Paradise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 445388](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/753/BHK_Configuration/753_1678021261_336e4f7fa0ad700c77f9afbf15d14612.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n484 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.07 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Rajputana Paradise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 445389](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/753/BHK_Configuration/753_1678021261_127d93e5a0ea9d962860f8560a0b29ff.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n559 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.26 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Rajputana Paradise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 22722](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/753/Floor%20Plan/753_1678021261_0417825033d7f964e2609c72f957697f.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Rigorous Supervision.\n* Blissful Surrounding View.\n* Prodigiously Designed Spaces.\n* Monumental Structure.\n* Well Planned Layout.\n* Designer Lobby.\n\n## Amenities Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Lift\n* Power Back Up\n* Solar Power\n* Meditation Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Senior Citizens' Walking Track\n* Parking and transportation\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Earthquake-resistant\n* Smart locks\n* 24/7 Security\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n\n* Community Club\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Themed Landscape Garden\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Aluminium sliding windows\n* Air-conditioned apartments\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles\n* Wash Basin\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Acrylic Emulsion Paint\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Multi-stranded cables\n* Laminated Flush Doors\n* Cp Fittings - Jaquar\n* Cp Fittings - Kohler\n\n## Walkthrough video Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West\n\n## Google Map Location of Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Kandivali West](/location-review/mumbai/kandivali-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Kandivali West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Kandivali West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nRajputana Paradise is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800003738](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800003738)\n\nProject: Rajputana Paradise\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West\n\n---\n\n* Nirmal Junior College\n* Balbharti College Of Commerce\n* Kandivili Education Society College\n* Kb Patil International School\n\n* Pooja Enclave/Oscar Hospital\n* Paarth Hospital\n* Namaha Hospital\n* Lotus Multispeciality Hospital\n\n* Reghu Leela Shopping Mall\n* Thakur Mall\n* Reliance Digital\n* D Mart\n\n* Sainath Refreshment\n* Swadesi Dairy Products\n* The Dessert Clubb\n* Cherrys Kitchen\n\n![Rajputana Associates](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/423_1678040170_untitled-155.webp)\n\n## [Rajputana Associates](/mumbai/sale/builder/rajputana-associates-423)\n\nOngoing Projects: 1\n\nCompleted Projects: 1\n\nTotal Projects: 2\n\n---\n\nRajputana Associates came into the picture in 1982 by Mr Kirti J. Kanther and has since flourished in different sectors. The company is diversified to explore new markets and has grown into a leading real estate developer. They ensure to bring a smile to the face of the customers and go a little extra mile.  \n  \nTheir intention is to offer services and touch lives and make a difference in the living! Rajputana Associates is working on building two esteemed projects; Rajputana paradise is planned to be developed in Kandivali West. Another project, the Rajputana Residency, is gaining attention and is located in Goregaon West.  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Rajputana Associates](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/rajputana-associates-423)\n\n## FAQ's about Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Kandivali West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Kandivali West\n\n* [Apartments in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/f