ox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Kandivali West](/buy/mumbai/kandivali-west-1a256b7a71)\n\n>\n\nRajputana Group\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rajputana-group-rajputana-paradise-1667196019.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rajputana-group-rajputana-paradise-bedroom-1671883940.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rajputana-group-rajputana-paradise-bedroom-1671884226.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rajputana-group-rajputana-paradise-bedroom-1671884344.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rajputana-group-rajputana-paradise-bedroom-1671883924.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/311022111605-newproject-2022-10-31t111341227.webp)\n\n# Rajputana Paradise\n\nRajputana Paradise, Hemukalani Rd Number 2, Kandivali, Paras Nagar, Irani Wadi, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067\n\nKandivali West\n\n₹95.83 L - 1.1 Cr\n\n₹95.83 L - 1.1 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nRajputana Paradise is a premium residential project in Kandivali West, developed by Rajputana Group, offering elegantly designed 2 BHK homes that combine comfort, style & convenience. Nestled in one of Mumbai’s most sought-after residential locations, the project provides residents with a perfect balance of modern architecture & serene living. With thoughtfully planned interiors, premium amenities & excellent connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping centers & business hubs, Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West ensures an elevated lifestyle for modern homebuyers seeking quality & sophistication.\n\n2 BHK\n\nUnder construction\n\nPossession in Dec 2030\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹19,800/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n484 - 559 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Premium 2 BHK spacious homes designed for modern comfort & functionality.\n* Ideal blend of elegance, comfort & convenience for family living.\n* Excellent connectivity to schools, hospitals, malls & transport hubs.\n* Peaceful residential surroundings with quick access to urban conveniences.\n\n* Located in the prime residential hub of Kandivali West, Mumbai.\n* Developed by the trusted Rajputana Group known for quality construction.\n* Thoughtfully designed interiors with optimum natural light & ventilation.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nSummary of Online Reviews High connectivity: Residents and visitors frequently mention the building’s proximity to Kandivali Railway Station and the Metro Line 2A as a major advantage. Modern construction: Reviews highlight the smart planning of the 21-story tower and the use of premium materials like vitrified tiles and marble. Family atmosphere: The society is described as well-managed and vibrant, making it a preferred choice for residential living in the Paras Nagar area. Proximity to essentials: Feedback indicates that the location is ideal for quick access to D-Mart, Raghuleela Mall, and various healthcare facilities.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nStrategic Location\n\nThe project is situated near Hemu Kalani Road, providing easy access to Swami Vivekanand Road and the Western Express Highway.\n\nPremium Specifications\n\nApartments feature high-end finishes including French windows for better natural light and branded bathroom fittings.\n\nEssential Amenities\n\nThe society offers reliable power backup, 24/7 security with CCTV, and a dedicated children’s play area.\n\nEfficient Layout\n\nUnits are designed to maximize space and ventilation, which is a recurring positive point in user feedback.\n\nSustainable Features\n\nImplementation of rainwater harvesting and solar power options contributes to long-term sustainability.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nTraffic Congestion\n\nThe surrounding roads, particularly during peak hours, are prone to heavy traffic and bottlenecking.\n\nCompact Units\n\nThe carpet areas for 1 and 2 BHK units are relatively small compared to older developments in the vicinity.\n\nLimited Open Space\n\nDue to the project's small land parcel, there is a lack of extensive green areas or large walking tracks within the premises.\n\nHigh Density\n\nBeing a single-tower project with over 100 units on a 0.21-acre plot, the common areas can feel crowded.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nExcellent for commuters\n\nHigh investment potential\n\nIdeal for nuclear families\n\nGood value for money\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/ac-waiting-lobby-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/ac-waiting-lobby-secondary.svg)\n\nAC Waiting Lobby\n\n![amenities/Car-Parking-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Car-Parking-secondary.svg)\n\nCar Parking Space\n\n![amenities/Entrance-Lobby-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Entrance-Lobby-secondary.svg)\n\nEntrance Lobby\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary.svg)\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-secondary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/Lobby-1-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Lobby-1-secondary.svg)\n\nWell Designed Entrance Lobby\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n![amenities/ac-waiting-lobby-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/ac-waiting-lobby-primary.svg)\n\nAC Waiting Lobby\n\n![amenities/Car-Parking-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Car-Parking-primary.svg)\n\nCar Parking Space\n\n![amenities/Entrance-Lobby-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Entrance-Lobby-primary.svg)\n\nEntrance Lobby\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-primary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-primary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multi-purpose-court-primary.svg)\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/walking-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-primary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/Lobby-1-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Lobby-1-primary.svg)\n\nWell Designed Entrance Lobby\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-primary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK\n\n* ## 484 sq. ft\n* ## 492 sq. ft\n* ## 559 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n2 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹95.83 L\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/rajputana-group-rajputana-paradise-2-bhk-bedroom-1671883416.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![school-primary](/assets/icons/school-primary.svg)\n\nschool\n\n![bank-secondary](/assets/icons/bank-secondary.svg)\n\nbank\n\n![hospital-secondary](/assets/icons/hospital-secondary.svg)\n\nhospital\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nKandivali Education Society’S Kes International School\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nMakhecha High School(English Medium)\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nSt. Theresa High School\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nThakur International School , Kandivali West\n\n0.5 km\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nThakur School Of Global Education\n\n0.5 km\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nYashwantrao B. Chavan High School\n\n0.5 km\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from₹1,00,140per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹1,20,16,810\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nRajputana Paradiseis a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800003738](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800003738)\n\nRajputana Paradise\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Rajputana Paradise?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Rajputana Paradise is 31 Dec 2030\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Rajputana Paradise?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Rajputana Paradise is 484 - 559 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Rajputana Paradise?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Rajputana Paradise is ₹95.83 Lacs - 1.1 Cr\n\n### Where is Rajputana Paradise located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nRajputana Paradise is located at Rajputana Paradise, Hemukalani Rd Number 2, Kandivali, Paras Nagar, Irani Wadi, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067.\n\n### What configurations are available in Rajputana Paradise?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nRajputana Paradise has 2 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Rajputana Paradise?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Rajputana Paradise is Under construction.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Rajputana Paradise?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are AC Waiting Lobby, Car Parking Space, Entrance Lobby, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Multipurpose Hall, Senior citizen Area, Walking Area, Well Designed Entrance Lobby, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Rajputana Paradise?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Rajputana Paradise is Rajputana Group.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Rajputana Paradise:Rajputana Group](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/311022111605-newproject-2022-10-31t111341227.webp)\n\n## Rajputana Group\n\nRajputana Group takes great pride in its diverse business ventures established since 1982. The group's extensive knowledge and depth of expertise have positioned it as a leader among marketing and distribution players. Their unwavering belief in the principle of let's grow together has fostered innovation, loyalty, and trust in every facet of their business. Their genuine pleasure in helping others achieve their dreams has, in turn, allowed the group to share happiness through their pioneering yet humble efforts. Their journey has led them to become one of India's top distribution channels, catering to leading pharmaceutical brands, consumer goods, telecom, electronics, healthcare, and lifestyle brands, while continually adapting to the evolving times.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/je-vee-infrastructure-shree-gopaldham-elevation-1762949548.jpg)\n\n![Shree Gopaldham](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/240522105543-jeeandvee.png)\n\nShree Gopaldham\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.45 Cr - 5.64 Cr\n\n3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rudra-amar-group-shivani-rudram-elevation-1755173792.jpg)\n\n![Shivani Rudram](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/260525085623-newproject-2025-05-26t205415973.webp)\n\nShivani Rudram\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.08 Cr - 2.34 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/ambit-builders-and-developers-ambit-primoris-elevation-1743572617.webp)\n\n![Ambit Primoris](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/300923111153-newproject-2023-09-30t111141705.webp)\n\nAmbit Primoris\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.98 Cr - 3.96 Cr\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-I