i West, Mumbai\n\n* [Ready to move properties in Kandivali West](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/ready-to-move-kandivali-west-1a256b6a2b7a71)\n* [Under construction properties in Kandivali West](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/under-construction-kandivali-west-1a256b6a1b7a71)\n\n[![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)](/)\n\n### OVERVIEW\n\n* [About Us](/about)\n* [Contact Us](/contact)\n* [Careers](/careers)\n* [Terms & Conditions](/terms-conditions)\n* [Privacy Policy](/privacy)\n\n### EXPLORE\n\n* [Developers](/developers)\n* [Blogs](/blogs)\n* [Press Mentions](/press-mentions)\n* [EMI Calculator](/calculator/emi-calculator-homeloan)\n\n### CITIES WE SERVE\n\n* [Kolkata](/kolkata)\n* [Mumbai](/)\n* [Navi Mumbai](/navi-mumbai)\n* [Pune](/pune)\n* [Thane](/thane)\n* [Alibaug](/alibaug)\n* [Bangalore](/bangalore)\n* [Noida](/noida)\n* [Palghar](/palghar)\n* [Raigad](/raigad)\n* [Telangana](/telangana)\n\n### FOLLOW US\n\n[![facebook-primary](/assets/icons/facebook-primary.svg)](https://www.facebook.com/blox.xyz/)[![instagram-primary](/assets/icons/instagram-primary.svg)](https://www.instagram.com/blox.xyz/)[![linkedin-primary](/assets/icons/linkedin-primary.svg)](https://www.linkedin.com/company/blox-xyz/mycompany/)[![twitter-x-primary](/assets/icons/twitter-x-primary.svg)](https://twitter.com/blox_xyz)[![youtube-primary](/assets/icons/youtube-primary.svg)](https://www.youtube.com/@BloxPropTech)[![mail-primary](/assets/icons/mail-primary.svg)\n\nEmail us at:](mailto:hello@blox.xyz)\n\n---\n\nMumbai H/O\n\nRERA ID : A51900029429\n\nMethod & Madness Technology Pvt. Ltd., Unit No. 1202, 12th floor, One International Center, Tower-3, Senapati Bapat Marg, Mumbai, Maharashtra - 400013\n\nRERA ID : A51900029429\n\nOffice no 303, Platinum Square, Sakore Nagar, Viman Nagar, Pune, Maharashtra - 411014\n\nRERA ID : WBRERA/A/NOR/2026/000949\n\nOffice no : 7W84C, 7th Floor, West Block, Mani Casadona, Plot No. IIF/04, Action Area- IIF, Newtown, Kolkata, West Bengal - 700160\n\n---\n\n© Copyright 2026Blox.xyz","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rajputana-paradise/147934/project","title":"Rajputana Paradise, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹73.58 Lac Onwards | 1, 2 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Rajputana Group developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rajputana-group-14774.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Rajputana Paradise Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rajputana-paradise-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Rajputana Paradise Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rajputana-paradise-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Rajputana Paradise Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rajputana-paradise-project-tower-view4.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹73.58 Lac - 1.34 Cr**\n\n₹22,750 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why Invest Through Square Yards?\n\n![Zero brokerage icon](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## About Rajputana Paradise, Kandivali West by Rajputana Group\n\n## Rajputana Paradise Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Rajputana Paradise.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  307 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 73.58 Lac** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  484 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.16 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  559 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.34 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nRajputana Paradise's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Kandivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Rajputana Paradise | Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 22750 | 27000 |\n| Mar 2026 | 22800 | 25100 |\n| Dec 2025 | 26800 | 25750 |\n| Sep 2025 | 23250 | 27100 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nRajputana Paradise avg. price is ₹ 22.8 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Kandivali West at ₹ 27 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Paradigm Casa Palazzo](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-casa-palazzo/100549/project \"Paradigm Casa Palazzo\") | ₹ 30,400 |\n| [Paradigm Codename True Value](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-codename-true-value/102364/project \"Paradigm Codename True Value\") | ₹ 30,050 |\n| [Paradigm Revive](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-revive/107077/project \"Paradigm Revive\") | ₹ 28,050 |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 27,000 |\n| Current Project **Rajputana Paradise** | ₹ 22,750 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Kandivali West ranges from ₹ 24.2 K to ₹ 75.6 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Rajputana Paradise | In Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 35 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 49.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 75.6 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Rajputana Paradise.\n\n#### MMRDA Plans Two New Ring Roads to Ease Mumbai Traffic\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is planning two additional ring routes, expanding its proposed network from seven to nine. These new corridors will cover approximately 307 km and will connect existing roads and planned projects across Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Rajputana Paradise, amounting to ₹ 94 L till August 2026.\n\n#### New Road Link Approved to Enhance Mumbai Connectivity\n\nThe Maharashtra government has approved a ₹1,722 crore road link project aimed at connecting the Versova-Bandra Sea Link with the Mumbai Coastal Road. This infrastructure development is expected to significantly improve traffic flow, reduce commuting times across the city.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### Goregaon-Mulund Link Road Project Receives ₹2,650 Crore in BMC Budget\n\nThe Goregaon-Mulund Link Road project has been allocated ₹2,650 crore in the BMC's FY26-27 budget. This crucial east-west connectivity project, which involves the construction of a 4.7 km twin-tube tunnel under the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, aims to ease traffic congestion on the Ghodbunder Road.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n#### Mumbai Local Trains Face Cancellations for Infrastructure Upgrade\n\nWestern Railway is undertaking essential infrastructure upgrades between Kandivali and Borivali from December 21, 2025, to January 18, 2026, leading to the daily cancellation of over 80 local trains. This includes work on tracks and crossovers, impacting suburban, passenger, and express train services. Nightly mega blocks are also in effect, causing further service disruptions.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Rajputana Paradise moved from ₹ 23,250/sqft to ₹ 26,800/sqft, reflecting a 15.27% rise.\n\nA total of 107 out of 110 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 83% of SHOP(5 out of 6 units), 97% of 2 BHK(61 out of 63 units), 100% of 1 BHK(39 units), RESI CUM COMMERICAL(2 units).\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Rajputana Paradise From Sep 25 to Aug 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 21.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 94 L | ₹ 21,200 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Sep 25 to Aug 26\n\n## Rajputana Paradise Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 1 BHK 307 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Rajputana Paradise, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 73.58 Lac\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 484 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Rajputana Paradise, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.16 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 559 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Rajputana Paradise, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.34 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Rajputana Paradise\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Rajputana Paradise to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Rajputana Paradise Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rajputana-paradise-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Rajputana Paradise Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rajputana-paradise-project-tower-view4.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Rajputana Paradise\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-kidsplay-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-rainwate-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-indoorga-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Rajputana Group Kandivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Rajputana Paradise.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Rajputana Paradise](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rajputana-paradise-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Hello Kids Pre School And Day Care Centre\n\n#### Vaishali Bhavan\n\n#### Lm Patel Rotary Eye Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Kandivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway and major roads\n\nLimited public transport\n\nVery good for visit Kandivali west\n\n— Rajubhau Sasane, Real estate agent\n\n## RERA Details of Rajputana Paradise\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Rajputana Paradise From Sep 25 to Aug 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 21.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-02-13 | Floor 18, Unit 1802 | A | 492 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-09-24 | Floor G, Unit 6 | N/A | 181 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Rajputana Paradise compare with similar projects?\n\n![Rajputana Paradise project in Kandivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rajputana-paradise-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Rajputana Paradise](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rajputana-paradise/147934/project \"Rajputana Paradise\")\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Sai Satguru project in Kandivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sai-satguru-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Sai Satguru](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/sai-satguru/6762/project \"Sai Satguru\")\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Group Satellite Aarambh project in Malad East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-group-satellite-aarambh-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Group Satellite Aarambh](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/group-satellite-aarambh/9814/project \"Group Satellite Aarambh\")\n\nMalad East, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Rajputana Group Track Record\n\n![Rajputana Group logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rajputana-group-14774.jpg?ai