com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ajmera-arham-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.00 Cr to 4.10 Cr\n\n![H Rishabraj Gautam Prabhu residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/h-rishabraj-gautam-prabhu-project-project-large-image1-7257.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.30 Cr to 4.76 Cr\n\n![Kabra Garnet residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kabra-garnet-project-project-large-image1-9745.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.16 Cr to 3.40 Cr\n\n![Paradigm Ananda Park residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/paradigm-ananda-park-project-project-large-image1-1792.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 99.00 Lac to 1.52 Cr\n\n![Kolte Patil Evara residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kolte-patil-evara-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.50 Cr to 2.43 Cr\n\n![BP DPS One residential project in Kandivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/bp-dps-one-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Studio, Apartment\n\n₹ 59.99 Lac to 1.70 Cr\n\n![DPS Greens residential project in Kandivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dps-greens-project-project-large-image1-5021.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.24 Cr to 2.50 Cr\n\n![Paradigm Ananda Phase 2 residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/paradigm-ananda-phase-2-project-project-large-image1-6736.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 99.00 Lac to 1.52 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Adarsh Heritage residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-adarsh-heritage-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Avenue residential project in Kandivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-avenue-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\nOffice Space\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Yugdharma residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-yugdharma-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mayfair Shyam residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mayfair-shyam-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.60 Cr to 2.27 Cr\n\n![Kalpataru Vatika residential project in Kandivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-vatika-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Rajputana Paradise\n\n### Can I get a home loan for Rajputana Paradise?\n\nYes, most major banks and NBFCs offer home loans for ready-to-move projects like Rajputana Paradise, subject to eligibility.\n\n### When was Rajputana Paradise completed and is it ready for possession?\n\nRajputana Paradise has received its completion and occupancy approvals. With a possession status of Ready to Move, buyers can move in immediately after completing purchase formalities.\n\n### Is Rajputana Paradise a Ready to Move project?\n\nYes, Rajputana Paradise is a Ready to Move residential project, allowing buyers to take possession immediately without any construction wait.\n\n### What should I inspect in Rajputana Paradise after getting possession?\n\nAfter taking possession at Rajputana Paradise, buyers should inspect electrical fittings, plumbing and water supply (municipal/borewell), elevator operations across 1, parking allocation, common areas, and verify that the flat matches the approved Oil Bound Distemper, Vitrified Tiles, RCC Frame Structure and inventory list before moving in.\n\n### Does Rajputana Paradise have an Occupancy Certificate (OC)?\n\nYes, Rajputana Paradise has received its Occupancy Certificate, confirming that the project is legally approved for residential use.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://jannathomes.com/project/rajputana-paradise/156","title":"Rajputana Paradise Kandivali West, Mumbai | Jannat Homes","raw_content":"# Rajputana Paradise\n\nBy The Rajputana Group\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\nStarting Price  1.09 Cr\n\nStarting Price 1.09 Cr\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/10/13/img_x_5006348113586fcf3-25060886.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/10/13/img_x_5006348113586fcf3-25060886.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/10/13/img_x_500634811315062b2-34381908.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/10/13/img_x_500634811315062b2-34381908.jpg)\n\n![Configuration](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/conf-plan.png)\n\nConfiguration   \n  2 BHK\n\n![Carpet Area](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/carpert-area.png)\n\nCarpet Area (Sq.ft)  \n  Start : 500 - End : 976\n\n![Price/Sq.ft](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/price-tag.png)\n\nPrice/Sq.ft  \n  21800.00\n\n![All in price](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/note.png)\n\nAll in one price  \n  1.09 Cr - 2.17 Cr\n\n[#### Overview](javascript:void(0);)\n\nNo of Towers\n\n1\n\nNo of Storeys\n\n21\n\nPossession Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\nPossession Date\n\nDec, 2023\n\nProject Rera No\n\nP51800003738\n\nAdvertiser Rera No\n\nA51800011711\n\n##### Introduction to Rajputana Paradise\n\nPresenting Rajputana Paradise, a project by well established developer, Rajputana Associates. The 21 storey residential tower is the fastest growing construction of Kandivali West. The project spacious 2 and 3 BHK homes.  Located in a prime location with Jain Mandir at Walking distance. Kandivali Railway Station, Western Express Highway, S.V. Road, New Link Road and Charkop Metro Station in close vicinity. Super Market (Dmart), PVR Cinema,Shatabdi Hospital, Ganesh Temple, Schools and Colleges within 10 minutes distance.  \n The project offers modern lifestyle amenities such as Terrace Garden, Roof Top Gym, Senior citizen Sit out area, Yoga section and many more are available here.\n\nThe possession date of the project is December 2023.\n\n[#### Amenities](javascript:void(0);)\n\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05052c6e003-72578577.jpg)CCTV\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/20/63297b5d04be28-67248754.jpg)Electrical Switchboard\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/07/63183c02c3bac4-84599175.jpg)Elevator\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05077e9b612-72077823.jpg)Garden\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315a9700faa70-06352851.jpg)Grand lobby\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05040b0b828-36177329.jpg)Gymnasium\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f0523d3ca665-43164855.jpg)Kids Play Area\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/631076c5888133-27323167.jpg)Regular Water Supply\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315a78f420df1-47241807.jpg)Rooftop garden\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/6310779b4752a9-36414246.jpg)Security\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315aafc3a2db1-08158002.jpg)Senior citizen area\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/20/63297bb7aa2099-57577726.jpg)Stainless Steel Sink\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f050680ed615-96265228.jpg)Terrace\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/08/25/63076704121bd4-42236428.jpg)yoga deck\n\n[#### Pricing, Floor Plans & Room Sizing](javascript:void(0);)\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Type | Carpet Area | Price () | Floor Plans | Room Sizes | PDF |\n[2 BHK](javascript:void(0))| 2 BHK | 500.00 Sq.ft | 1.09 Cr | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/projects/floor_plan/2022/10/13/e8dd8a3144949f6a3c9a6a65cd341368.pdf) |\n\n[#### Location](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[#### The Rajputana Group](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/developer/logo/2022/10/13/6348089cd4bf91-21151525.jpg)\n\n* Established In\n* Total Projects\n\nThe Rajputana Group is prevalent only because of its core professional team. Also, we take pride in leading the team with high-quality management. The investors and shareholders believe in a steady yet unique hands-on approach to run the various businesses. The group takes efforts in getting involved at the helm to manage all the affairs related to the team. We as a group nurture and epitomise an exclusive blend of professionalism and entrepreneurship. We club them together to give a state of the art working experience to our employees. We not only map management tools like balance score cards, yearly appraisals, etc. but we also work towards motivating and encouraging them with various activities. There are picnics, cricket matches and various refreshing activities that we believe helps our employees to relax and concentrate well on their work. The epitome of efforts that we put for our employees is to create a top most working environment for them. We also take a special interest in helping our employees on their personal front. A balanced life and sound minded employee yields not only good work but it also becomes a vital member of the huge family.\n\n[#### Brochure](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/images/pdf_icon.png)\n\nRajputana Paradise](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/projects/brochure/2022/10/13/a6981898535ac500e3d225533792d666.pdf)\n\n* [Request Info](#request-info)\n* [Schedule Tour](#schedule-tour)\n\n##### I'm interested\n\n###### Please enter the details below.\n\n##### Price\n\n###### Please enter the details below to get the detailed pricing information.\n\n[Whatsapp](https://wa.me/919821113656?text=Please%20contact%20me)\n\nEnquire Now\n\n### Looking To Sell Or Rent Your Property?\n\nWe'll help you to to get.\n\n[List your Property](https://jannathomes.com/list-your-property)\n\n[Whatsapp](https://wa.me/919967867100?text=Please%20contact%20me)\n\nEMI Calculator\n\n[Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/shoaibshaikh.in?igsh=MWUybjY5dnJsMWs5OA==)\n\n#### Large modal\n\n...\n\n##### Modal title\n\n![](https://jannathomes.com/assets/images/logo.jpg)\n\n##### AC Products and Repair\n\n##### Log In To Your Account!\n\nBy Signing Up You Agree To Our [Terms And Conditions](https://jannathomes.com/terms-conditions) And [Privacy Policy](https://jannathomes.com/privacy-policy).\n\nDo Not Have An Account? Sign Up\n\n##### Create An Account\n\nBy Signing Up You Agree To Our [Terms And Conditions](https://jannathomes.com/terms-conditions) And [Privacy Policy](https://jannathomes.com/privacy-policy).\n\nAlre