utana Paradise](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/29153/29153-oth-.webp?width=400&height=300&mode=crop&anchor=topcenter)\n\n![Floor Plan](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/29153/29153-floor.webp?width=400&height=300&mode=crop&anchor=topcenter)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n![Site Plan](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/29153/29153-plan.webp?width=400&height=300&mode=crop&anchor=topcenter)\n\nSite Plan\n\n## 🏊 Amenities & Features (13 amenities)\n\nCommon (8)\n\n🏢 Grand entrance lobby🏋️ Gymnasium🏢 High speed elevators🏃 Jogging Track🧒 Kid's play area🌳 Landscaped garden🏢 Outdoor Games⚡ Power Backup\n\nInterior (4)\n\n🏠 Imported Sanitary Fittings🏠 Intercom/CCTV🏠 POP finished walls🏠 Vitrified flooring\n\nKitchen (1)\n\n🪨 Granite Platform\n\n## 📄 E-Brochures & Documents\n\n🔒 Share your details to receive brochures directly on WhatsApp.\n\n📄\n\nRajputana Paradise Brochure\n\n🔐 Share details to download\n\n## Floor plans & site plans\n\n🔒 Share your details to receive floor plans directly on WhatsApp.\n\n![Floor Plan preview](/fp-preview/29153/0.webp)\n\nFloor plan — share details to view\n\n![Site Plan](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/29153/29153-plan.webp)\n\n🗺️ Site Plan — 🔐 Share details to view\n\n## Other buildings in Kandivali West\n\n[![Bhairav Ocean Breeze](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/33347/12.avif)\n\nBhairav Ocean Breeze\n\nKandivali West · ₹21,500/sqft](/project/bhairav-ocean-breeze-kandivali-west/33347)[![Ruparel Sky Greens](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/24851/1.webp)\n\nRuparel Sky Greens\n\nKandivali West · ₹19,849/sqft](/project/ruparel-sky-greens-kandivali-west/24851)[![Vora Icon](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/28529/28529-main.webp)\n\nVora Icon\n\nKandivali West · ₹35,644/sqft](/project/vora-icon-kandivali-west/28529)[![Sai Elegance](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8